```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: scales by one million with two trailing commas")
# Hand-verified: 12,345,678 / 1,000,000 = 12.345678 -> 1 decimal -> 12.3
expect(format_number(12345678.0, "0.0,,")).to_equal("12.3")
```

